  <entry>
    <title>密码学</title>
    <link href="http://example.com/2025/11/08/crypto/"/>
    <id>http://example.com/2025/11/08/crypto/</id>
    <published>2025-11-08T00:58:31.950Z</published>
    <updated>2025-11-15T16:16:24.392Z</updated>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="编码"><a href="#编码" class="headerlink" title="编码"></a>编码</h1><h2 id="ASCII编码"><a href="#ASCII编码" class="headerlink" title="ASCII编码"></a>ASCII编码</h2><p><img src="/images/ASCII%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81%E8%A1%A8.png" alt="对照表"><br>可以使用<code>ord()</code>函数将字符转换为ASCII码，使用<code>chr()</code>函数将ASCII码转换为字符。<br>例：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python"><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]: ch=<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]: <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(ch)<br>    Out[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]: <span class="hljs-number">97</span><br><span class="hljs-meta">&gt;&gt;&gt; </span>In[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: <span class="hljs-built_in">chr</span>(<span class="hljs-number">97</span>)<br>    Out[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: <span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span><br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="Base系列编码"><a href="#Base系列编码" class="headerlink" title="Base系列编码"></a>Base系列编码</h3><p>Base 系列编码原理</p><h4 id="一-通用编码步骤"><a href="#一-通用编码步骤" class="headerlink" title="一. 通用编码步骤"></a>一. 通用编码步骤</h4><ol><li>原始数据转二进制<br>   将待编码的每个字符按 ASCII 码转成 8 位二进制。</li><li>重新分组<br>   按新的 bit 数（4、5 或 6）从左到右切分，不足时补 0。</li><li>转十进制并查表<br>   将每个二进制组转成十进制，作为索引查编码表得到对应字符。</li><li>处理末尾<br>   若最后组不足新 bit 数长度，补 0 并在编码结果末尾加 &#x3D;（Base64&#x2F;Base32 有填充，Base16 一般不需要）。</li></ol><hr><h4 id="二-三种编码对比"><a href="#二-三种编码对比" class="headerlink" title="二. 三种编码对比"></a>二. 三种编码对比</h4><p>编码类型 分组 bit 数 字母表 填充字符<br>Base16 4 bit 0123456789ABCDEF 无<br>Base32 5 bit ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ234567 &#x3D;<br>Base64 6 bit ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789+&#x2F; &#x3D;</p><hr><h4 id="三-举例说明（Base64）"><a href="#三-举例说明（Base64）" class="headerlink" title="三. 举例说明（Base64）"></a>三. 举例说明（Base64）</h4><p>字符串 “A”</p><p>· ASCII: 65 → 二进制 01000001<br>· 按 6 bit 分组：010000 010000（第二个组只有 2 位，补 4 个 0）<br>· 十进制：010000 &#x3D; 16 → Q；010000 &#x3D; 16 → Q<br>· 补了 1 组 0，所以加 2 个 &#x3D;<br>· Base64 结果：”QQ&#x3D;&#x3D;”</p><hr><p><img src="/images/base%E7%BC%96%E7%A0%81.png" alt="对照表"></p><p>例：</p><figure class="highlight python"><table><tr><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs python">In[<span class="hljs-number">1</span>]: s = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;bmN0Znt0aGlzX2lzX2Jhc2U2NF9lbmNvZGV9&quot;</span><br>In[<span class="hljs-number">2</span>]: <span class="hljs-keyword">import</span> base64<br>In[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: base64.b64decode(s)<br>Out[<span class="hljs-number">3</span>]: <span class="hljs-string">b&#x27;nctf&#123;this_is_base64_encode&#125;&#x27;</span><br><br><span class="hljs-comment">## 古典密码</span><br><span class="hljs-comment">### 凯撒密码</span><br>加密方法：将明文中的每个字母按照字母表顺序向前或向后移动固定的位数，形成密文。<br><br>标准凯撒密码加解密代码：<br>```python<br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">caesar_encrypt</span>(<span class="hljs-params">plaintext, key</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;凯撒密码加密&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br>    ciphertext = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> char <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> plaintext:<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> char.isupper():<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 大写字母加密</span><br>            ciphertext += <span class="hljs-built_in">chr</span>((<span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(char) - <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>) + key) % <span class="hljs-number">26</span> + <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;A&#x27;</span>))<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">elif</span> char.islower():<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 小写字母加密</span><br>            ciphertext += <span class="hljs-built_in">chr</span>((<span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(char) - <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>) + key) % <span class="hljs-number">26</span> + <span class="hljs-built_in">ord</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&#x27;a&#x27;</span>))<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">else</span>:<br>            <span class="hljs-comment"># 非字母字符原样保留</span><br>            ciphertext += char<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> ciphertext<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">caesar_decrypt</span>(<span class="hljs-params">ciphertext, key</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;凯撒密码解密&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> caesar_encrypt(ciphertext, -key)<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">def</span> <span class="hljs-title function_">brute_force_caesar</span>(<span class="hljs-params">ciphertext</span>):<br>    <span class="hljs-string">&quot;&quot;&quot;暴力破解凯撒密码，输出所有26种可能&quot;&quot;&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;暴力破解结果：&quot;</span>)<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> key <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">range</span>(<span class="hljs-number">26</span>):<br>        plaintext = caesar_decrypt(ciphertext, key)<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;Key <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;key:2d&#125;</span>: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;plaintext&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br><br><span class="hljs-comment"># 测试示例</span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> __name__ == <span class="hljs-string">&quot;__main__&quot;</span>:<br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 示例1：标准凯撒密码</span><br>    plaintext = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;the quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog&quot;</span><br>    key = <span class="hljs-number">3</span><br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;原始明文:&quot;</span>, plaintext)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 加密</span><br>    encrypted = caesar_encrypt(plaintext, key)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;加密结果:&quot;</span>, encrypted)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 解密</span><br>    decrypted = caesar_decrypt(encrypted, key)<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;解密结果:&quot;</span>, decrypted)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n&quot;</span> + <span class="hljs-string">&quot;=&quot;</span>*<span class="hljs-number">50</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 示例2：处理你提供的密文</span><br>    your_ciphertext = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;whitxlfneurzqiramxpsvryhunkhodcbgrj&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;你提供的密文:&quot;</span>, your_ciphertext)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 尝试用不同密钥解密</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> test_key <span class="hljs-keyword">in</span> [<span class="hljs-number">3</span>, <span class="hljs-number">4</span>, <span class="hljs-number">5</span>]:<br>        result = caesar_decrypt(your_ciphertext, test_key)<br>        <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">f&quot;Key <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;test_key&#125;</span>: <span class="hljs-subst">&#123;result&#125;</span>&quot;</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;\n&quot;</span> + <span class="hljs-string">&quot;=&quot;</span>*<span class="hljs-number">50</span>)<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-comment"># 暴力破解示例</span><br>    sample_cipher = <span class="hljs-string">&quot;wkh txlfn eurzq ira mxpsv ryhu wkh odcb grj&quot;</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">print</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;暴力破解示例:&quot;</span>)<br>    brute_force_caesar(sample_cipher)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="简单替换密码"><a href="#简单替换密码" class="headerlink" title="简单替换密码"></a>简单替换密码</h3>]]></content>
    
    
      
      
